		(property "Info" "Supports CAN V2.0B specification, the communication speed 1Mb/s. /     5V DC power supply module, SPI interface protocol control. /     Working current: 5mA (1 microamp standby current. Except the power indicator). /      0 to 8-byte data field. With standard frame, expand the frame and remote frame. /     120 ohm termination resistors. With impedance matching, ensures the drive capacity, long-distance data transmission against signal radiation."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
